# The SMK-37 build's own controls (build/host/zen_host_smk37): the pads and their lights, the outer keys, < >, the
# faders (a scene's Volume page, the instrument's HOME page; each takes over once it moves), the wheels (the
# instrument's bend and vibrato). ZEN-1 boots into Sakura.
wait 800
wait 2000
expect mode 1
# a scene: every pad lit dark orange
expect padr0 110
expect padg0 38
expect padb0 0
expect padr15 110
shot smk-sakura.png
# the pads are the white keys, low notes on the bottom row: pad 8 (bottom left) white key 0, pad 0 (top left) 8
pad 8
wait 20
expect keynote 3
pad 0
wait 20
expect keynote 11
pad 15
wait 20
expect keynote 10
# a pad held: bright; let go: dark orange again
pad 9 down
wait 50
expect padr9 190
expect padg9 230
expect padb9 255
pad 9 up
wait 50
expect padr9 110
# the outer keys play an octave in: C3 as C4 (white key 4), C6 as C5 (white key 11)
kbkey 0
wait 20
expect keynote 7
kbkey 36
wait 20
expect keynote 14
kbkey 12
wait 20
expect keynote 7
# < >: the knob pages (as SEL / FX): the first shows the scene's page, the next ones step
sbtn RIGHT
expect page 0
sbtn RIGHT
expect page 1
sbtn RIGHT
expect page 2
sbtn LEFT
expect page 1
# the faders: the Volume page (Notes, Drone, Air, Water). A fader takes over only once it moves
expect knob4 80
fader 0 65
wait 50
expect knob4 80
fader 0 127
wait 50
expect knob4 100
fader 0 0
wait 50
expect knob4 0
fader 1 100
wait 50
expect knob5 79
fader 3 32
wait 50
expect knob7 25
expect page 1
shot smk-faders.png
# a scene: the wheels do nothing
wheel pitch 127
wheel mod 127
wait 50
expect smkbend 0
expect smkvib 0
wheel pitch 0
wheel mod 0
wait 50
# the instrument (PATCH held): the faders take over again only once they move; HOME's page
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
expect mode 0
# the instrument: the tonics light blue, the rest dark orange
expect padr8 40
expect padb8 210
expect padr9 110
expect padr13 40
fader 2 65
wait 50
expect par12 80
fader 2 30
wait 50
expect par12 24
fader 2 127
wait 50
expect par12 100
expect view 0
sbtn RIGHT
expect view 1
sbtn RIGHT
expect view 2
sbtn LEFT
sbtn LEFT
expect view 0
sbtn LEFT
expect view 3
sbtn RIGHT
expect view 0
fader 3 33
wait 50
expect par26 55
fader 3 10
wait 50
expect par26 8
# a pad plays the koto, bright while it sounds
pad 10 down
wait 300
expect nvoices >0
expect keylevel2 >5
expect padr10 190
# the pitch wheel bends what sounds (as OCT+ / OCT- held), back at rest
wheel pitch 127
wait 300
expect smkbend 2
expect bend10 >950
wheel pitch 0
wait 600
expect smkbend 0
expect bend10 0
wheel pitch -127
wait 300
expect smkbend 1
expect bend10 <-100
wheel pitch 0
wait 600
expect bend10 0
# the mod wheel: vibrato while it is up
wheel mod 100
wait 50
expect smkvib 1
wheel mod 0
wait 50
expect smkvib 0
pad 10 up
wait 3000
shot smk-koto.png
# back to the scene: the wheels let go
wheel mod 127
wait 50
expect smkvib 1
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
expect mode 1
expect smkvib 0
wheel mod 0
wait 50
